{"data":[{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-03-05T14:33:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1765022907791782318"],"id":"1765022907791782318","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":125,"impression_count":225362,"like_count":1297,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":50,"retweet_count":26},"text":"你谈了两个双胞胎。\n是的，两个，不是双胞胎的其中一个。\n只是他们彼此不知道。\n你享受于两人双份的共同优点，也沉迷于分辨两人的不同。\n老话说的好：撑死胆大的。\n老话也说了：常在河边走，哪能不湿鞋。\n你被人蒙着眼睛，脱得精光，捆住双手双脚扔到地上的时候。\n才悟到这句，可惜，有点晚了。","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1765022907791782318"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-03-04T06:13:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1764534704437440722"],"id":"1764534704437440722","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":62,"impression_count":132670,"like_count":788,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":43,"retweet_count":16},"text":"你养的小狗长了一个和脸不太相符的大鸡鸡。\n好吧，他的身材和脸也不怎么相符。\n所以他坐在你的身上正面骑乘你的时候，你总是喜欢坏心眼地抓着他的几把，然后扇他的龟头。\n还要每扇一次就让他叫：谢谢妈妈。\n有时候你把人玩得忍不住了，他就转过身去，只给你留一个骚屁股，让你看着他饥渴吞吐的后穴。","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1764534704437440722"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-28T16:07:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1762872080444637352"],"id":"1762872080444637352","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":55,"impression_count":287540,"like_count":206,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":49,"retweet_count":5},"text":"【清水书信】应无期\n“你还是你，是自由的无拘无束的风。可是小乖，我永远都没有勇气抓住你。”\n“我试图反复提醒自己应该继续爱你。后来这些记忆逐渐模糊。”\n#男喘 #台本 #男喘台本 #清水 #书信 #BE https://t.co/SH817hqgRb","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1762872080444637352"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-28T04:57:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1762703477002961084"],"id":"1762703477002961084","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":49195,"like_count":109,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":27,"retweet_count":1},"text":"o！！！！！\n两万fo了！！！\n谢谢大家的喜欢！！！\n两万福利就把那个be本子更了吧\n嘿嘿嘿 https://t.co/zUDSPluXWL","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1762703477002961084"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-27T04:47:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1762338638535528763"],"id":"1762338638535528763","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":23999,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1762324310407184575","type":"quoted"}],"text":"好耶\n都来听听俺们狗狗吧👏👏 https://t.co/bOVZC1Hxza","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1762338638535528763"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-26T15:00:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1762130591242498051"],"id":"1762130591242498051","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":29052,"like_count":77,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"（小师弟2.0）\n虽然小师弟在你们面前总是一副长不大的样子。\n但下山除魔卫道、匡扶正义的时候，端的一手老成持重的架子。\n动起手来也是一副不要命的做派，所以十次下山，八次都要带着伤回来。\n哪怕是身上的道袍被砍得乱七八糟，刀伤剑伤一汩汩地流着血，也呲着牙笑着说都没有师傅的戒鞭打得痛。","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1762130591242498051"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-26T12:06:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1762086799999123890"],"id":"1762086799999123890","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":108,"impression_count":183310,"like_count":969,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":38,"retweet_count":24},"text":"周末清晨，你在他怀里醒来。\n脑子里还是刚刚那个意犹未尽的春梦。\n梦有什么好的，总比不上正儿八经的来一次。\n于是你黏黏糊糊地用头拱他的胸膛，手攀上他的腰，有一下没一下地乱摸。\n见他不醒，你的手下移，抓住他晨勃的几把上下撸动。\n他像是睡死了一样没反应，你气得咬了一口他胸上的肉。","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1762086799999123890"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-26T04:12:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1761967365959618721"],"id":"1761967365959618721","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":21247,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1761759544043241797","type":"quoted"}],"text":"呦西！！ https://t.co/lJTWPYXSa4","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1761967365959618721"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-25T14:54:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1761766599567253701"],"id":"1761766599567253701","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":39,"impression_count":100854,"like_count":321,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":8},"text":"你是他从孤儿院领养的小孤儿。\n领养你的时候你已经十岁了，所以对这个半路杀出来的爸爸，只算得上是口头的承认。\n你才不想当他的女儿，毕竟女儿没办法一辈子都黏在他身边。\n所以，当他被你的大学室友看到，并开玩笑的说了一句“我看你爸也是风韵犹存”的时候，你眨眨眼，逃避着说不过如此。","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1761766599567253701"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-24T15:51:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1761418580414058882"],"id":"1761418580414058882","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":43208,"like_count":122,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":1},"text":"你和男朋友早早的买好了奇奇怪怪的汤圆儿，等着元宵节挨个尝一尝。\n结果却在前一天收到了临时出差的消息。\n你收拾行李的时候，嘴撅得几乎能挂一个油瓶。\n他一边帮你收行李，一边宽慰你，说哪天尝都是一样的，他等着你。\n可是你觉得期盼了好久的元宵节计划被打乱了。其他时候吃，就没有意义了。","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1761418580414058882"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-24T15:16:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1761409851463491813"],"id":"1761409851463491813","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":30961,"like_count":74,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":2},"text":"今天是元宵节，你的小狗早早的把你赶出家门，让你去采买过节需要的东西。\n自己留在家里，神秘兮兮地说要给你准备礼物。\n你嘴上说着：元宵节哪有准备礼物的。\n心里几乎一刻都不停地猜测着今天会收到什么样的礼物。\n人虽然在外面，但整颗心都黏在小狗身上。","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1761409851463491813"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-21T14:02:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1760303968230772986"],"id":"1760303968230772986","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":44192,"like_count":112,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"你算不上笨，只是有的时候反应有点慢。\n是恰到好处的可爱和好逗。\n按照少女小说的走向，应该有一个学校里的天之骄子莫名其妙得对你心动。\n然后别扭地向你示爱和你纠缠。\n但现实不是小说，天之骄子确实有，但和你只是普通的同学关系。\n只有你的舍友，随口提了一句，说你俩谈了得挺有意思。","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1760303968230772986"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-02-21T11:04:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1760259282053022060"],"id":"1760259282053022060","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":16,"impression_count":164586,"like_count":596,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":28,"retweet_count":20},"text":"你同时接触了两个男生。\n用你的话说，一个适合结婚，一个适合偷情当小三。\n话是这么说，但总是要做取舍。\n你的朋友说：酒后吐真言，喝醉一次，看看脑子里第一个人想到的是谁，那谁就是你的选择。\n你照做。\n结果喝到字都认不清楚，唯一强撑着发的语音，还发给了文件传输。","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1760259282053022060"}],"includes":{"tweets":[{"author_id":"1473705491344011264","created_at":"2024-02-27T03:50:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1762324310407184575"],"id":"1762324310407184575","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":25536,"like_count":20,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"皎月褶皱\n台本老师@HnrBB2nai https://t.co/ldBObBpzqM"},{"author_id":"1510906318776938496","created_at":"2024-02-25T14:26:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1761759544043241797"],"id":"1761759544043241797","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":17,"impression_count":50338,"like_count":87,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":3},"text":"#男喘 #四爱 #女性向 #早泄 #贞操锁 \n\n小猫你怎么高潮的这么快！\nfanbox：https://t.co/6Mmt2pDl3Y https://t.co/XItdXTv0Qe"}],"users":[{"id":"1229453490537107457","name":"人间杀爸客（不放授权版","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1950068769885462528/Z5noQeeo_normal.jpg","username":"HnrBB2nai","verified":false},{"id":"1473705491344011264","name":"修狗","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1778367221682839552/X5MWMpIB_normal.jpg","username":"itota_spring","verified":false},{"id":"1510906318776938496","name":"小猫","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2003186924803239936/p9IDV5RT_normal.jpg","username":"Relly_enioy_you","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"1765022907791782318","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3fr5tcjnr5d0qha3u94ygex166xnud9","oldest_id":"1760259282053022060","result_count":13}}